S1M3M3	0.28	* M3.2a, same as metal2
E1M3V2	0.06	* V2.x, conservative
E1M3V3	0
W2V3	0
E1M4V3	0
S1M4M4	0
W2V4	0
E1M4V4	0
E1M5V4	0
S1M5M5	0
W2V5	0
S1IPIP	0.4	* PP.2
S1ININ	0.4	* NP.2
W2V6	0
